      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَادٍ مُسْفَهٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A valley filled</i> [<i>with water</i>]: (K,
TA:) as though it exceeded the due bounds, and
became such as is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِيه</span>: imagined to be
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أسْفَهْتُهُ</span> signifying “ I found him to be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِيه</span>. ”
(TA.)

